     The ggeettvvffssbbyynnaammee() function returns the value 0 if successful; otherwise
     the value -1 is returned and the global variable _e_r_r_n_o is set to indicate
     the error.

EERRRROORRSS
     The following errors may be reported:

     [ENOENT]           The _n_a_m_e argument specifies a file system that is un‐
                        known or not configured in the kernel.

